Ex. PW1/7 (OSR) is copy of my Aadhar Card; Ex. PW1/8 (OSR) is copy of Aadhar Card of son of petitioner namely Rachit Jain; Ex. PW1/9 (OSR) is copy of Aadhar Card of daughter of petitioner namely Reetika Jain; Ex. PW1/10 (OSR) is copy of the GST registration of firm of petitioner;

Ex.PW1/11 (OSR) is copy of consent letter dated 26.09.2017;
Mark A ( Ex. PW1/12 is de-exhibited) are copy of rent receipt dated 05.07.2019;
Ex. PW1/13 (OSR) is copy of surrender letter dated 02.07.2020;
PANKAJ by PANKAJ SHARMA SHARMA Date: 2024.11.11 12:18:20 +0530 Ex.PW1/14 (OSR) is copy of rent agreement dated 01.07.2020;
Ex. PW1/15 (OSR) is copy of PAN card of petitioner;

Ex. PW1/16 (OSR) (Colly) are copies of sale invoices ;
Ex. PW1/17 (OSR) (Colly) is copy of ITR of petitioner for the A.Y. 2020-21 as well as balance sheet;
Ex. PW1/18 (OSR) (Colly) is copy of ITR of petitioner for the A.Y. 2019-20;
Ex. PW1/19 (OSR) (Colly) is copy of ITR of petitioner for the A.Y. 2018-19 as well as balance sheet;

Ex. PW1/20 (OSR) is copy of death certificate of father of petitioner;
Mark B (Ex. PW1/21 is de-exhibited) is copy of PAN card of mother of petitioner;
Ex. PW1/22 (OSR) (Colly) are letter of appointment and salary slips of son of the petitioner; Mark C (Ex. PW1/23 is de-exhibited) the copy of ID card issued by Delhi University to the daughter of the petitioner;
